1
00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:14,010
-What are you guys doing up? -Finishing the crossword.
你們在幹什麼？填完字謎再去睡覺

2
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:17,740
Do you know a six-letter word for "red"?
三個字，也是紅色的一種

3
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:20,010
Dark red.
深紅色

4
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:25,650
Wrong, but there's a connect-the-dots in here for you later.
應該不是 不過你待會可以玩連連看

5
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,020
Hey,how about maroon?
赭紅色呢？

6
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,520
Yes! You are so smart!
沒錯，你好聰明

7
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:35,860
You guys are so cute.
你們好可愛喔 

8
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,120
I know.
我知道

9
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,030
See you in the morning.
好，明天早上見 好

10
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,950
I love doing crossword puzzles with you.
我最喜歡跟你填字謎了 

11
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,110
Me too.
我也是

12
00:00:58,290 --> 00:01:00,690
Now let's finish this and go to bed.
趕快填完去睡覺 好

13
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:02,450
Only one left.
只剩一個

14
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:06,160
Three-letter word. Not dog,but....
兩個字的動物 不是小狗，是…

15
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,620
Cat.
貓咪

17
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,460
You are so smart!
沒錯，你好聰明

18
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:17,030
I love you.
我愛你 

19
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:18,700
I love you too.
我也愛你

20
00:01:32,826 --> 00:01:35,192
The One with the Cop
本集播出：「搬沙發」

21
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,780
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

22
00:02:23,340 --> 00:02:24,700
We still need a tip.
還差小費 

23
00:02:24,910 --> 00:02:27,340
All right. Hold on.
好，等等

24
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:28,940
I got it.
有了…

25
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,900
Nickel.
5分錢

26
00:02:31,950 --> 00:02:34,410
-How much do we need? -Couple of bucks.
還差多少？ 2塊錢

27
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,180
Okay,dime.
10分錢

28
00:02:37,420 --> 00:02:40,410
You guys keep talking. This could take a while.
你們繼續聊，我要花一點時間

29
00:02:40,690 --> 00:02:41,850
Wait,look it!
等等，你們看

30
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,560
This is a police badge!
天哪，這是警徽

31
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:49,790
Cool. But why would a cop come in here? They don't serve doughnuts.
真酷，但警察來這裡幹嘛？ 這裡又不賣甜甜圈

32
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:55,870
Could you discover the badge again? I can do better than that.
你能不能重來一次 我可以說個更好笑的

33
00:02:57,140 --> 00:02:59,200
I bet somebody's missing that badge.
一定有人正在找那個警徽

34
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:02,710
I should take it back. But at the police station...
沒錯，我應該送回去 我去了警察局

35
00:03:02,940 --> 00:03:04,880
...I'll check their 10 Most Wanted List.
還可以看看十大通緝犯名單

36
00:03:05,110 --> 00:03:08,880
My friend's been number 11 forever. This could be her year!
我朋友麗西一直是第十一大 她今年也許會出運

37
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:13,780
-Hey,you guys. -Hey,Joey.
大家好 嗨，喬伊

38
00:03:16,220 --> 00:03:18,660
Is that my sweatshirt?
那是我的衣服嗎？

39
00:03:18,890 --> 00:03:22,230
Yes,it is. I'm sorry. I was cold. I hope it's okay.
對，我很冷就借來穿了 沒關係吧？ 

40
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:25,990
It's just that if you wear someone's sweatshirt...
你要穿應該穿...

42
00:03:26,270 --> 00:03:28,460
...shouldn't it be your boyfriend's?
...你男朋友的衣服

43
00:03:28,740 --> 00:03:30,100
And I'm not him.
我不是你的男朋友

44
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,810
I'm sorry. I'll give it back.
對不起，我現在就還你 

45
00:03:34,580 --> 00:03:37,170
It's gonna be all smelling like Monica.
不要，上面會沾滿你的味道

46
00:03:38,010 --> 00:03:39,270
Do I smell bad?
你是說我很臭嗎？

47
00:03:40,350 --> 00:03:42,910
You smell like a meadow.
不是，你有一股青草香

48
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:46,180
I'm sorry.
對不起

49
00:03:49,490 --> 00:03:50,510
What's with him?
他是怎麼了？

50
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:55,130
The last time Joey went to a meadow his mother was shot by a hunter.
喬伊上次去青草地 他媽媽被獵人射殺了

51
00:03:58,630 --> 00:04:01,400
Look what I found. It's a police badge.
你看，我找到一個警徽

52
00:04:01,570 --> 00:04:04,830
What's that doing here? I don't see any doughnuts.
怎麼會？我又沒看到甜甜圈

53
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:09,670
Cops and doughnuts. Come on.
條子和甜甜圈啊

54
00:04:10,010 --> 00:04:12,640
If Chandler had said it you'd all be on the floor.
如果是錢德說的 你們就會笑翻了

55
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:15,280
Cops, doughnuts? Me?
條子、甜甜圈、我？

56
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:35,230
I still don't know.
我還是不確定

57
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:39,340
I want to make sure I bought the right couch, one that says...
抱歉，我想買到理想的沙發 能讓人覺得...

59
00:04:39,570 --> 00:04:43,870
..."Kids welcome here," but that also says...
...「小朋友，歡迎」 同時也能讓人覺得 ...

61
00:04:44,150 --> 00:04:45,580
..."Come here to me."
...「來我身邊吧」

62
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:51,480
What? You say that to kids?
什麼？你對小朋友說那種話？

63
00:04:53,660 --> 00:04:58,180
The "Come here to me" is, you know,for the ladies.
不是，「來我身邊吧」 是對小姐們說的

64
00:04:59,060 --> 00:05:02,150
Ross, honey, it's a nice couch, it's not a magic couch.
這是張好沙發 但不是神奇沙發

65
00:05:04,230 --> 00:05:06,560
Well,you picked a great couch.
你的選擇很正確

66
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:08,390
-Sign here, please. -Sure.
請在這裡簽個名 沒問題

67
00:05:09,540 --> 00:05:13,530
The delivery charge is almost as much as the couch!
這是…運費幾乎跟價格一樣貴

69
00:05:13,780 --> 00:05:16,740
That's ridiculous. He lives three blocks away.
太扯了，他家離這裡才三條街

70
00:05:17,010 --> 00:05:19,840
I'll take it myself. Thank you.
算了，我自己搬就好，謝謝

71
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:23,210
All right, Rach, come on. Let's go.
瑞秋，來吧 好

72
00:05:28,890 --> 00:05:30,720
Are you kidding?
開什麼玩笑

73
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:35,690
Come on. It's only three blocks. It's not very heavy. Try it.
才三條街，又不是很重 抬抬看，快

74
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,940
Oh,I can do it.
我行嘛

75
00:05:43,370 --> 00:05:45,930
You two will really enjoy that couch.
你們會很喜歡這張沙發的

76
00:05:46,710 --> 00:05:48,870
We're not together.
我們不是一對

78
00:05:50,210 --> 00:05:52,910
Something didn't quite add up there.
好，難怪我覺得怪怪的

79
00:05:59,820 --> 00:06:02,050
What's that supposed to mean?
這話是什麼意思？ 

81
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,920
Well,you. Her.
你，她

82
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:06,920
I mean,she's very...
她很… 

83
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:08,390
...you know.
你知道

84
00:06:08,660 --> 00:06:09,990
And you're,like...
而你卻…

85
00:06:10,630 --> 00:06:11,620
...you know?
...你知道

86
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:18,640
Not that it's any of your business, but we did go out.
雖然與你無關 但我們確實交往過

87
00:06:18,910 --> 00:06:21,240
Really? You two?
真的？你們兩個？

88
00:06:21,510 --> 00:06:24,970
I don't want to do this now. I'm carrying a heavy couch.
我現在不想講這個 我抬著一張很重的沙發

90
00:06:25,250 --> 00:06:27,510
Then tell him quickly.
那就趕快告訴他

91
00:06:28,150 --> 00:06:29,950
Fine. We went out.
好，我們交往過 

92
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:32,450
Not only did we go out...
不只交往過

93
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:35,590
...we did it 298 times!
還做過298次 羅斯

94
00:06:39,790 --> 00:06:43,530
You kept count? You are such a loser!
我實在…你居然有在算？ 你真沒用

95
00:06:44,670 --> 00:06:48,530
A loser you did it with 298 times!
再沒用你也做了298次

96
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:59,270
Excuse me,ma'am. You can't put your cigarette out on a tree.
這位小姐 怎樣？ 你不能在樹上摁香煙

98
00:06:59,610 --> 00:07:01,210
Yeah,I can. It worked well.
我可以，很方便

99
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:05,180
But you shouldn't. So don't ever do that again.
你不該這麼做，別再這麼做了

100
00:07:05,390 --> 00:07:08,320
I won't. Till I have my next cigarette.
我不會了… 抽下一根煙之前不會

101
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:09,780
Hold it!
站住

102
00:07:10,060 --> 00:07:11,960
N.Y.P.D. Freeze,punk!
紐約警察，別動

103
00:07:13,960 --> 00:07:17,060
That's right. You are so busted.
沒錯，你被活逮了

104
00:07:17,670 --> 00:07:18,720
Book them.
把她帶走！

105
00:07:20,570 --> 00:07:23,560
-Who are you talking to? -Save it,red!
你在跟誰說話？ 別掙扎了

106
00:07:23,910 --> 00:07:27,810
Apologize to the tree or spend the night in the slammer.
不想在籠子裡過夜 就跟那棵樹道歉

107
00:07:28,410 --> 00:07:30,880
I am not apologizing to a tree.
我才不跟一棵樹道歉

108
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:35,070
You apologize to the tree right now or I am calling for backup.
趕快道歉，否則我要叫人了

109
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,710
Backup! Backup!
來人啊，來人啊

110
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:40,650
I'm sorry! Sorry!
對不起，對不起 

111
00:07:40,860 --> 00:07:43,920
Okay,cancel backup! Cancel backup!
別來了，別來了

112
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:50,020
Didn't you say there was an elevator in here?
羅斯，你不是說有電梯？

113
00:07:50,230 --> 00:07:53,000
Yes,I did,but there isn't. Here we go!
我是有說，但其實沒有 來吧

114
00:07:54,100 --> 00:07:57,470
Don't you think we should rethink the whole hiring movers thing?
你要不要找個搬運工

115
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:59,330
No way. They're a rip-off.
才不要，他們會敲竹槓

116
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:03,200
They check out your stuff and come back later and steal it.
而且他們會先看準東西 再回來偷

117
00:08:03,380 --> 00:08:06,640
-It's true. I saw it on Dateline. -Oh，I love Dateline.
是真的，我在日線報導上看過 我好喜歡日線報導

118
00:08:06,810 --> 00:08:09,610
Jane Pauley is the one woman I would kiss.
珍寶莉是我唯一想親的女人

119
00:08:11,190 --> 00:08:14,710
-There's just something about her. -Rach,can we concentrate?
我不知道… 瑞秋，專心一點好嗎？

120
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:19,250
Yeah,fine. I listened to your dumb story.
好，只有你能講

121
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:21,190
Okay,go left.
往左

122
00:08:21,430 --> 00:08:23,020
Left. Left.
左，左…

123
00:08:23,330 --> 00:08:27,030
Okay,you know what? There's no more left left.
已經沒有左了

124
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,930
Lift it straight up over your head.
好，抬高到你的頭上 

125
00:08:30,170 --> 00:08:32,370
Straight up. You can do it!
抬高 你行的

126
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,940
You can do it!
你行的

127
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:35,700
Okay. You got it?
沒問題吧？

128
00:08:35,980 --> 00:08:37,470
-Go,go. -Good,good.
很好

129
00:08:37,710 --> 00:08:40,770
You got it,right? You got it,right? You got
沒問題吧？沒問題吧？沒問…

130
00:08:45,620 --> 00:08:48,450
Any chance you think it looks good there?
你覺得放在那裡好看嗎？

131
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:51,490
This guy was all:
這傢伙還在碎碎念 

132
00:08:52,690 --> 00:08:54,850
And I'm all, "Buffay! Homicide!"
我就說重案組布非

133
00:08:56,660 --> 00:08:58,330
It was just so cool!
真是酷斃了

134
00:08:58,870 --> 00:09:03,630
-You were supposed to take it back. -I'm having fun doing good deeds.
菲比，你應該拿去還的 我知道，但行善的感覺好棒
 
136
00:09:04,170 --> 00:09:07,470
You can get arrested for impersonating a police officer.
但假扮警察很嚴重，你會被捉

137
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:10,170
You could get arrested right now!
你現在就會被捉

138
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:16,710
I'd better take it back. I'm totally drunk with power.
我得拿去還 我被權力沖昏頭了

139
00:09:27,230 --> 00:09:30,220
Yeah. I didn't know you guys would be here.
喬伊 我不知道你們會在

140
00:09:30,430 --> 00:09:33,060
-Do me a favor. Taste this. -What? Why?
喬伊，你嘗嘗看 什麼？為什麼？

141
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:36,630
It's okay, Joe, she's a trained chef.
放心，她是專業廚師

142
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:41,000
Actually,I was looking for Phoebe.
其實我要找菲比

143
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:44,900
Well,you just missed her.
你剛跟她擦身而過

144
00:09:45,350 --> 00:09:46,400
Was that her?
那是她嗎？

145
00:09:46,950 --> 00:09:49,180
-I gotta go. -Joey,wait a minute. Wait.
我去追她 喬伊，等等

146
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:51,780
-What is with you? -Nothing.
你是怎麼了？ 沒事啊 

147
00:09:51,950 --> 00:09:53,610
You're acting strange.
拜託，你一整天都怪怪的

148
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:57,180
All right. There is something.
好吧，是有一件事 

149
00:09:57,990 --> 00:10:00,360
I kind of had a dream.
我做了一個夢…

150
00:10:01,230 --> 00:10:03,460
But I don't want to talk about it.
但我不想談

151
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:06,560
What if Martin Luther King had said that?
馬丁路德金也這麼說還得了

152
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:10,830
I kind of have a dream.
我有一個夢…

153
00:10:11,910 --> 00:10:13,970
I don't want to talk about it.
但是我不想談

154
00:10:15,740 --> 00:10:18,040
Look,it involved Monica.
跟摩妮卡有關

155
00:10:18,250 --> 00:10:21,040
You had a dream about the girl I'm seeing? Cool.
你夢到我在交往的女孩？真酷 

156
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:23,510
I dreamt about the girls he was seeing.
我不知夢見他的女朋友多少次

157
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:27,020
Let's talk about your dream. I love you. Your dream?
總之我們在談你的夢 我愛你…你的夢？

158
00:10:27,860 --> 00:10:30,980
There was no sex. I haven't dreamt of her like that...
放心，沒有任何性意味

159
00:10:31,230 --> 00:10:33,890
...since I found out about you two. More or less.
自從發現你們的事 我就不對她做那種夢了

160
00:10:38,700 --> 00:10:40,760
What was the dream about?
那你夢到什麼？

162
00:10:43,070 --> 00:10:46,670
You were my girlfriend. We were doing the crossword puzzle.
好吧，你是我的女朋友 我們在填字謎

164
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:48,700
Like you did last night.
就像你們昨晚那樣

165
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:52,110
That's it. I'm in love with Monica. I'll move out.
就這樣，我愛上摩妮卡了 我會搬走

166
00:10:52,410 --> 00:10:56,080
Joey, come on. That doesn't mean you're in love with me.
喬伊 等等，那並不代表你愛我

167
00:10:56,850 --> 00:10:57,880
It doesn't?
不是嗎？ 

168
00:10:58,090 --> 00:10:59,780
It could mean anything. Like...
它可能有很多涵義，例如…

169
00:11:00,050 --> 00:11:03,460
...you're jealous that I've become the apartment stud.
你突然眼紅我成為這裡的猛男

170
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:06,090
Sounds like your dream.
聽起來比較像你的夢

171
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:13,760
Or it could mean you saw Chandler and me being close and stuff...
或是你看到我和錢德很親密 

172
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:15,800
...and you want that too.
你也想跟別人擁有這種關係

173
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,930
In the dream I did enjoy the closeness.
我在夢裡的確很享受那種親密

174
00:11:20,140 --> 00:11:23,770
If that's what it was,that'd be great. I wouldn't have to move.
如果是這樣就太好了 我就不必搬走了

175
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:26,300
Are you attracted to Monica?
你現在對摩妮卡有興趣嗎？

176
00:11:26,580 --> 00:11:30,240
Right here,right now, are you attracted to her?
此時此刻 你對她有興趣麼

177
00:11:32,490 --> 00:11:34,510
-Not really. -There you have it!
其實沒有 這就對了

178
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:38,190
Well,sure! I'm just wearing sweats!
是啊，我穿得這麼輕便

179
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:40,790
But that's good!
但那是好事

180
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:44,120
You're not in love with me. You just want a girlfriend.
你不是愛我 你只是想交個女朋友

181
00:11:44,330 --> 00:11:46,930
It's not just about getting a girlfriend.
我覺得不是交女朋友的問題

182
00:11:47,170 --> 00:11:51,760
I could get a girlfriend. We could sit and do crossword puzzles.
我可以找個女朋友 我們可以坐在那裡填字謎

183
00:11:51,970 --> 00:11:54,840
But could we have the closeness like you have?
但我們會擁有你們那種親密嗎

184
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:59,300
Monica and I were friends before we dated. Maybe that's it.
摩妮卡和我是從朋友做起 也許關鍵在這裡

185
00:11:59,550 --> 00:12:01,520
Friends first?
先做朋友？

186
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,270
That's interesting.
有意思

187
00:12:04,490 --> 00:12:08,180
-You become friends after? -No,never done that either.
你們都事後當朋友？ 也從來沒有過

188
00:12:09,460 --> 00:12:11,690
Do you guys have a tape measure?
你們有量尺嗎？ 

189
00:12:11,890 --> 00:12:14,220
Yeah. It's actually in my bedroom.
有，在我房裡

190
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,130
That's right.
沒錯

191
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,640
What's up,Joey?
喬伊，怎麼了？

192
00:12:34,350 --> 00:12:35,980
How you doing?
你好嗎？

193
00:12:44,530 --> 00:12:46,990
Excuse me. Is this your car?
抱歉，這是你的車嗎？ 對

194
00:12:47,260 --> 00:12:50,390
Don't park here. You're blocking the entrance.
停在這裡不太好 你擋住出入口了

195
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:52,560
Don't worry. It's not a problem.
放心，沒關係的

196
00:12:52,770 --> 00:12:57,670
It's a problem for me, so it's a problem for you, because I'm a cop.
我覺得有關係，你就有關係 因為我是條子

197
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,410
So am l.
我也是

198
00:13:03,883 --> 00:13:05,851
完了

199
00:13:07,580 --> 00:13:10,710
Okay. So you're a cop. You can park anywhere.
好，你是條子，可以任意停車 

200
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,910
I know,because I'm a cop too.
這個我知道，因為我也是條子

201
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:15,550
Keep up the good work. 10-4.
好，繼續努力，收到

202
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:18,550
Wait. So, what precinct are you with?
等一下，你是哪個分局的？

203
00:13:19,090 --> 00:13:21,290
I'm with the 57th.
我在57分局 

204
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:24,860
-I know a guy in Homicide up there. -I'm in Vice.
我認識你們重案組一位刑警 我在風化組

206
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:28,560
In fact,I'm undercover right now. I'm a whore.
事實上我正在臥底，我是妓女

207
00:13:30,940 --> 00:13:32,630
Who else is in Vice there?
風化組還有誰？

208
00:13:33,370 --> 00:13:34,640
Do you know...
你認識...

209
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,100
...Sipowicz?
西波威茲嗎？ （影集「霹靂警探」主角名）

210
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:38,970
Sipowicz? I don't think so.
西波威茲？應該不認識

211
00:13:39,250 --> 00:13:42,310
Yeah. Sipowicz. Yeah. Big guy, kind of bald.
西波威茲，大塊頭，有點禿

212
00:13:42,750 --> 00:13:44,620
I don't know him.
我不認識他

213
00:13:45,820 --> 00:13:49,120
Don't try to call him. He's not there. He's out.
不要打給他 他不在，他出去了

214
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:51,920
His partner just died.
他的拍檔剛死了

215
00:13:53,130 --> 00:13:55,890
Tell Sipowicz I'm real sorry for his loss.
幫我跟西波威茲致意 

216
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:58,590
I sure will. Take care.
我會的，保重

217
00:13:58,800 --> 00:14:01,430
By the way, I'm sure Sipowicz will be all right.
對了 我相信西波威茲不會有事的

218
00:14:01,670 --> 00:14:04,570
I heard that kid from Silver Spoons is really good.
聽說那個新來的小伙子很不錯

219
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:09,400
Where'd you find my badge?
你在哪裡找到我的警徽的？

220
00:14:19,990 --> 00:14:23,480
Could you give me and Ross a hand moving his couch?
喬伊 你能不能幫我和羅斯搬沙發？

221
00:14:23,660 --> 00:14:27,150
I'd love to,but I got acting class. But you know what?
我很想，但我要去上表演課

222
00:14:27,330 --> 00:14:30,490
I guess I could blow that off. For you.
不過我可以為了你蹺課

223
00:14:35,770 --> 00:14:40,100
Let me ask you something. I was talking with Monica and Chandler.
我問你一件事 我剛在對面跟摩妮卡錢德聊天

225
00:14:40,310 --> 00:14:42,210
Boy,they are really tight.
他們可真親密

226
00:14:42,440 --> 00:14:43,430
I know.
是啊 

227
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:46,540
That's not a bad situation they got there.
那種關係實在很不錯

228
00:14:48,150 --> 00:14:50,050
Think I'll get me one of those.
我也想自己弄一段

229
00:14:53,320 --> 00:14:54,690
What's up,Joe?
你想說什麼？

230
00:14:55,460 --> 00:14:58,620
I think Monica and Chandler are so great...
我覺得他們感覺會那麼好 

231
00:14:58,830 --> 00:15:01,390
...because they were friends first.
是因為他們是先做朋友

232
00:15:01,660 --> 00:15:05,960
So I asked myself,who are my friends? You and Phoebe.
於是我問自己：誰是我朋友？ 你和菲比

233
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:08,500
I saw you first,so....
而我先遇見你，所以…

234
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:16,130
-What are you saying? -Maybe you and I crank it up a notch.
你在說什麼？ 我是說也許你我可以更進一步

235
00:15:20,010 --> 00:15:21,570
You know,honey...
喬伊 

236
00:15:21,850 --> 00:15:24,150
...as flattered as I am...
...你先遇見我...

237
00:15:24,390 --> 00:15:27,010
...that you saw me first...
...令我受寵若驚...

238
00:15:27,820 --> 00:15:31,590
...I just don't think we should be cranking anything up.
但我不覺得我們應該更進一步

239
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:35,360
I'll treat you real nice.
我會對你很好

240
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:43,530
Yeah. Well,you know....
你知道嗎…

241
00:15:45,410 --> 00:15:50,370
I think it's a great idea to become friends with someone before you date.
我覺得先做朋友再交往 是一個很好的想法

242
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:54,740
But the way you do it is you meet someone, become their friend...
但你應該先去認識一個人 跟她做朋友

243
00:15:54,950 --> 00:15:58,410
...build a foundation, then ask them out on a date.
建立基楚，再約她出去

244
00:15:58,690 --> 00:16:01,120
Don't hit on your existing friends.
別對現有的朋友下手

245
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,390
Won't that take longer?
那不是要很久？

247
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:09,960
Oh,but once you find it...
沒錯，但是一旦得到了

248
00:16:10,230 --> 00:16:12,290
...it's so worth the wait.
真的很值得

249
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:15,730
I understand.
我懂

250
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:16,960
Good.
我懂

251
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:20,530
Man,I wish I saw Phoebe first.
真想先遇見菲比

252
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:25,270
Come here to me.
來我身邊吧

253
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:29,580
No,no. You come here to me.
不，你來我身邊

254
00:16:32,450 --> 00:16:36,150
-I brought reinforcements. -Great! You brought Joey?
羅斯，我帶援軍來了 太好了，是喬伊嗎？

256
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:37,790
The next best thing.
只比他差一點

257
00:16:40,230 --> 00:16:44,100
You brought Chandler? The next best thing would be Monica!
你帶錢德來？ 只差一點的是摩妮卡

258
00:16:45,230 --> 00:16:49,130
I would be offended,but Monica is freakishly strong,so....
我應該要不爽 但摩妮卡真的壯得可怕

259
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:52,270
I drew a sketch of how we'll do it.
我畫了一張搬運草圖

260
00:16:52,470 --> 00:16:54,410
Rach,that's you.
瑞秋，這是你

261
00:16:54,610 --> 00:16:56,670
That's the couch.
這是沙發

262
00:16:57,510 --> 00:16:58,910
What's that?
那是什麼？ 

263
00:16:59,150 --> 00:17:00,640
That's me.
那是我

264
00:17:04,990 --> 00:17:07,280
Certainly think a lot of yourself.
你把自己看得很雄偉喔

265
00:17:09,020 --> 00:17:10,960
No. That's my arm.
不，那是我的手臂

266
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:19,430
I see. I thought you just really, really liked your new couch.
我還以為你那麼哈你的新沙發

267
00:17:22,500 --> 00:17:24,200
Just follow my lead.
總之聽我的指示 

268
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:28,600
Come on,Chandler.
錢德，來吧

269
00:17:30,110 --> 00:17:31,440
-All right. -Okay.
好

270
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,150
Here we go.
開始了

271
00:17:34,110 --> 00:17:36,380
All right. Ready?
可以了嗎？ 可以

272
00:17:36,820 --> 00:17:37,840
Turn!
轉

273
00:17:38,090 --> 00:17:39,070
Turn!
轉

274
00:17:39,290 --> 00:17:40,380
Turn!
轉

275
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:45,690
-I don't think we can turn any more! -I don't think it'll fit!
應該是轉不動了 我覺得擠不上去 

276
00:17:45,890 --> 00:17:48,330
Yeah,it will. Come on! Up,up,up!
當然可以，快抬起來

277
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:51,130
Up! Yes!
抬起來

278
00:17:51,670 --> 00:17:53,000
Here we go! Pivot!
很好，中心點

279
00:17:54,330 --> 00:17:55,390
Pivot!
中心點

280
00:17:57,170 --> 00:17:58,230
Pivot!
中心點

281
00:17:59,210 --> 00:18:00,200
Pivot!
中心點

282
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,200
Pivot!
中心點

283
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,470
Pivot!
中心點

284
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:08,410
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!
閉嘴！閉嘴！閉嘴

285
00:18:12,750 --> 00:18:15,190
I don't think it'll pivot any more.
我看是上不來了 

286
00:18:15,490 --> 00:18:16,820
You think?
是嗎？

287
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:22,930
All right,let's bring it back down and try again.
搬下去再來一次

288
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,500
I think it's really stuck now.
現在真的卡死了

289
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:38,600
-I can't believe that didn't work. -I know. Me neither.
居然沒成功 就是啊

291
00:18:38,910 --> 00:18:40,540
I mean,you had a sketch.
你都畫了圖了

292
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:45,080
What did you mean when you said "pivot"?
你說中心點是什麼意思？

293
00:18:51,660 --> 00:18:53,680
Man,I cannot figure this out.
我就是轉不出來

294
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:57,860
Yeah, because it's not 1985.
因為現在不是1985年

295
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:02,490
You guys,guess what? I ditched a cop.
你們知道嗎？ 我剛甩掉一個條子

296
00:19:02,900 --> 00:19:04,060
-What? -What do you mean?
什麼意思？

297
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:07,000
He caught me using his badge and he tried to bust me.
他逮到我用他的警徽想捉我 

298
00:19:07,170 --> 00:19:09,640
Damn real cops!
死真條子

299
00:19:10,010 --> 00:19:11,340
How far did he chase you?
他追了你多遠？

300
00:19:11,510 --> 00:19:15,310
Well,he didn't really. He just picked up his badge and stood there.
其實沒追 他撿起警徽之後就杵在那裡

301
00:19:15,980 --> 00:19:18,680
Maybe we'll see you on World's Most Boring Police Chases.
也許你會上 「史上最無趣警匪追逐戰」

302
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:23,490
-Why did you run? -I had to.
你為什麼要跑？ 我非跑不可

303
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:27,150
You know, impersonating a cop is like a Class E felony.
假扮警察是...

304
00:19:27,330 --> 00:19:30,590
Two to four years minimum. I am not going back to that hellhole.
2到4年的重罪 我才不要回那個苦窯
 
305
00:19:34,740 --> 00:19:37,600
If I can just get it to pivot...
要是能找出中心點 

306
00:19:37,770 --> 00:19:39,860
...we'll be back on track.
就能繼續搬了

307
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:45,970
-Rach,can I get some help please? -Yeah.
瑞秋，幫幫忙好嗎？ 好

308
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:50,580
Turn it off! Turn it off!
快關掉

309
00:19:52,450 --> 00:19:56,320
Maybe the firemen can help us move the couch when they get here.
也許消防隊員可以幫你搬

310
00:19:57,120 --> 00:20:01,250
-Wait,wait,wait. -It's a new couch! It's a new couch!
等等 不要踩沙發，小心

311
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:11,430
How's it going? Make any new friends?
怎樣？有交到新朋友嗎？

312
00:20:11,670 --> 00:20:13,700
Yeah. I met this woman.
有，我認識了一個女人

313
00:20:16,280 --> 00:20:17,940
What's she like?
她怎麼樣？

314
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:19,640
Well,she's...
她的...

315
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,280
...really good in bed.
...床上功夫很棒

316
00:20:23,050 --> 00:20:27,350
-You were going to be friends first. -Hey,it's all your fault.
你不是要先當朋友？ 都是你的錯

318
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:28,510
Why?
為什麼？

319
00:20:28,690 --> 00:20:31,660
You didn't give me advice. You gave me a pickup line.
你給的不是忠告，是搭訕詞

320
00:20:31,860 --> 00:20:35,690
I told her I wanted to build a foundation and be friends first.
我一說要建立基楚，先當朋友

321
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:40,700
Suddenly, through no fault of my own, I became irresistible to her!
她突然就…與我本身無關 覺得我難以抗拒

322
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,030
And her roommate.
她的室友也是

323
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,900
What about the closeness?
那親密關係呢？

324
00:20:47,410 --> 00:20:51,710
Closeness, schmosness. There was three of us, for crying out loud!
親密個頭！我們三個叫成一團

325
00:20:56,420 --> 00:20:57,970
Who wants pizza?
誰要吃披薩？ 

326
00:20:58,220 --> 00:20:59,650
I do! I do! I do!
我要

327
00:21:00,390 --> 00:21:04,220
This is great! Can you believe I found it on the second floor?
贊！這是我在二樓撿到的

328
00:21:07,190 --> 00:21:09,160
-Who is it? -N.Y.P.D.
哪一位？ 紐約警察

329
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:10,390
Oh,my God!
天哪 

330
00:21:11,830 --> 00:21:13,420
Just a minute,officer!
等一下，警察先生

331
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:27,580
-I'm looking for Phoebe Buffay. -My God,it's him! It's that cop!
我要找菲比布非 完了，是那個警察

333
00:21:27,850 --> 00:21:31,750
-I can't believe he found me! -Are you gonna go to jail?
他居然找到我了 天哪，你會坐牢嗎？

335
00:21:32,250 --> 00:21:35,120
If I go down, you guys go down with me.
我要死也要拖你們下水

336
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:40,720
Harboring a fugitive? That's one to three years minimum.
窩藏逃犯起碼要關1到3年

337
00:21:41,130 --> 00:21:43,030
Good luck, Chandler.
錢德，祝你好運

338
00:21:46,470 --> 00:21:50,370
Arrest me, but you'll never make it stick and you know it.
好，你可以逮捕我 但你抓不到我的把柄

339
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:53,940
I have no choice,it's my job. You understand, right?
但我別無選擇 這是職責所在，你暸解吧？

340
00:21:54,140 --> 00:21:56,970
And you understand that I'm calling my lawyer.
只要你暸解我會找我的律師來

341
00:21:57,210 --> 00:22:01,040
And once he puts you on the stand, he'll make you look like a fool!
他會讓你在庭上像個豬頭 豬頭！

342
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,780
I don't like looking foolish.
我不喜歡當豬頭

343
00:22:05,390 --> 00:22:09,410
Maybe I don't arrest you today. Maybe I came by and you weren't here.
這樣吧，我今天不捉你 就說我來了，但你不在

344
00:22:09,660 --> 00:22:11,820
I'd love it if I weren't here!
我不在就太好了

345
00:22:12,630 --> 00:22:16,620
Since you're not going to jail tonight, I was wondering if you'd...
既然你今晚不會入獄 我能不能...

346
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:19,060
...Iike to go to dinner with me?
...請你去吃飯？

347
00:22:19,800 --> 00:22:20,790
-Me? -Yeah.
我？ 對

348
00:22:21,230 --> 00:22:25,070
Ever since you flashed my badge I can't stop thinking about you.
自從你對我亮警徽 我就對你念念不忘

349
00:22:25,340 --> 00:22:29,140
You're the prettiest fake undercover whore I've ever seen.
你是我見過最美的假臥底妓女

350
00:22:30,740 --> 00:22:31,940
Nice.
漂亮

351
00:22:34,750 --> 00:22:38,180
I didn't see that coming. You're asking me out.
我想不到你會約我出去

352
00:22:38,420 --> 00:22:41,850
I could've done it better, but these people keep staring at me.
我可以表現得更好 但這些人一直盯著我

353
00:22:42,690 --> 00:22:46,180
I'd like to go out with you, officer.
我願意跟你吃飯，警察先生

354
00:22:47,090 --> 00:22:48,820
-Gary. -Gary.
蓋瑞

355
00:22:49,100 --> 00:22:51,000
-Okay, so it's a date. -Yeah.
那就這麼說定了 好

356
00:22:51,260 --> 00:22:53,820
I gotta ask you, though. How'd you know where to find me?
不過我一定要問 你是怎麼找到我的？

357
00:22:54,100 --> 00:22:57,000
You're fingerprints were all over my badge so I just ran it through the computer.
我的警徽上都是你的指紋 我上電腦查詢

358
00:22:57,270 --> 00:22:59,970
And this was listed as your last known address so I just checked it out.
這是你最後登記的住址 所以我就來看看

359
00:23:00,170 --> 00:23:01,200
Impressive.
好厲害 

360
00:23:01,440 --> 00:23:05,780
Not as impressive as you. I looked at your record and you've done some pretty weird stuff.
沒有你厲害 我看過你的紀錄 你幹過不少怪事

361
00:23:06,510 --> 00:23:07,610
We'll talk at dinner.
吃飯再說 好

362
00:23:09,320 --> 00:23:12,880
-So I'll come by and pick you up? -All right,I can't wait.
我2個小時後來接你？ 好，我好興奮

